            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बूढ़ा (būṛhā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from buḍḍha, \"old\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 9271). CDIAL notes that the initial b- rules out direct descent from Sanskrit vṛddha, \"grown old\", though that word may have influenced it."
